0,0,0,1,1.5,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Kanji-furigana,Duality,30,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1Style: OP13-Karaoke,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Translation,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Kanji,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,110,1Style: OP13-Credits,FOT-Greco Std B,40,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,95,100,1,0,1,2.2,0,1,80,10,100,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, Text﻿[Script Info]; Script generated by Aegisub 3.2.2; http://www.aegisub.org/Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.601PlayResX: 1280PlayResY: 720Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.34,0:00:30.38,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing SewilDialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:36.19,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Quality Control Galaxy 9000 Grug PepperjackDialogue: 0,0:00:36.19,0:00:41.16,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Timing Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.16,0:00:46.90,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Translation YibisDialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:52.33,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Visual Effects Datenshi KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:52.33,0:00:57.41,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Graphics DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:03.05,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Karaoke KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:01:03.05,0:01:06.53,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking HaleeDialogue: 0,0:01:06.53,0:01:08.65,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Raws df68Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.00,0:02:42.42,Title,,0,0,0,,Navy HeadquartersDialogue: 0,0:02:55.09,0:02:58.92,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like you barely managed to hold on to your lives.Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.61,0:03:04.65,Captions,,0,0,0,,Impel DownDialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:02.08,Main,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't shown up with the antidote...Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:05.44,Main,,0,0,0,,you'd all be dead by now.Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.44,0:03:07.43,Main,,0,0,0,,You underestimated Magellan.Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:11.43,Main,,0,0,0,,We're still alive!Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.43,0:03:16.45,Main,,0,0,0,,You were... destined to come here.Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.71,0:03:22.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I really thought we were going to die. Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.10,0:03:24.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Seems like we...Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.60,0:03:26.89,Main,,0,0,0,,got lucky this time.Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.56,0:03:34.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Heaven chooses who survives, Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:36.92,Main,,0,0,0,,but if you give up, you've already lost!Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.88,0:03:42.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Might as well live in the moment. Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.33,0:03:44.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shiryu!Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.16,0:04:01.29,Main,,0,0,0,,It was nice of you to save us. Thanks a lot.Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.29,0:04:03.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I welcome you once again.Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.61,0:04:05.66,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll make a fine addition to our crew!Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.66,0:04:09.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I have no future here.Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:12.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I was hoping to meet a man like you.Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.02,0:04:25.49,Captions,,0,0,0,,The World Government's Private Route:Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.02,0:04:25.49,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Tarai CurrentDialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:27.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Let vus rest Inazuma here.Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.49,0:04:31.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? You mean the poison has affected him that badly?Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:34.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Vi was able to treat the poison he hit vme with,Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.30,0:04:38.66,Main,,0,0,0,,using vmy Healing and Tension Hormones...Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.36,0:04:50.47,Main,,0,0,0,,But that technique has some nasty side effects.  It can even shorten your lifespan.Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.78,0:04:55.97,Main,,0,0,0,,It'd be better for him to recuperate naturally.Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.50,0:05:00.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Once vyour lifespan has been shortened, vyou'll never be able to reclaim the years vyou've lost.Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.45,0:05:03.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Inazuma is an important newkama to the Revolutionary Army.Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.29,0:05:08.72,Main,,0,0,0,,He shouldn't overexert himself now.Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:20.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You know, he wasn't such a bad guy, after all.Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.05,0:05:24.33,Main,,0,0,0,,We just reunited, Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.33,0:05:26.80,Main,,0,0,0,,and he's gone and saved me again!Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.58,0:05:32.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Bon-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.90,0:05:33.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother Bon!Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.80,0:05:34.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Bon-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.91,0:05:38.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Bon-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.85,0:05:44.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, how long're you guys  gonna stand 'round sobbin' for?Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.77,0:05:47.81,Main,,0,0,0,,He was a good guy but he's dead now.Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.81,0:05:50.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's just celebrate!Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.88,0:05:52.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Celebrate our freedom!Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.18,0:05:58.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Or, if you'd like, we could make it a wake for Mr. 2.Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.68,0:06:05.36,Main,,0,0,0,,What a bloody nice service!Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.65,0:06:11.15,Main,,0,0,0,, Bon-chan could still be alive, big-nose!Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.15,0:06:13.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Who're you callin' big-nose?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:17.04,Main,,0,0,0,,You, you red-nosed, round-nosed, stupid-nosed idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.04,0:06:21.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, you've got a rubbery, stretchy, stupid face!Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:22.75,Main,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.48,0:06:26.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, just do whatever the hell you want.Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.84,0:06:39.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought only Merfolk were able to talk to fish. Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:42.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you were able to summon whale sharks. Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.98,0:06:46.82,Main,,0,0,0,,What's odd about a fishman being on good terms with sea creatures?Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.54,0:06:50.24,Main,,0,0,0,,It's just odd. Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.24,0:06:52.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, for such a savage race... Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.34,0:06:55.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I suppose you're an exception.Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.82,0:06:59.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll take that as a compliment.Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.94,0:07:03.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't deny that Fishmen are savage. Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.46,0:07:05.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Bon-chan isn't dead!Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.46,0:07:09.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy got a second red nose!Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.66,0:07:14.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun.Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:20.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I have a chance to help with rescuing Ace-san.Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.08,0:07:23.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm indebted to you.Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:25.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't mention it.Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.60,0:07:30.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm glad you're with us. You're really strong!Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:38.10,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This isn't the first time I've been indebted to you.Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.10,0:07:40.60,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I should express my gratitude and apologies but...Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.60,0:07:43.41,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,we must focus on our current objective.Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:47.19,Main,,0,0,0,,You can call me Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.19,0:07:52.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I used to be one of the Seven Warlords, but I've abandoned that title!Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.48,0:07:56.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's unleash hell at Navy HQ!Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:08:03.00,Main,,0,0,0,,We must save Ace-san,  so that Okama-kun's efforts won't go to waste!Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:04.62,Main,,0,0,0,,A warlord?Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.62,0:08:06.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Navy HQ?Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:08.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.97,0:08:12.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey! You were one of the Seven Warlords?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.54,0:08:14.54,Main,,0,0,0,,No wonder you're so strong!Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.40,0:08:20.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Forgive me. I should have introduced myself sooner.Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.62,0:08:22.56,Main,,0,0,0,,It's surprising you didn't know...Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:26.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! What do you mean, “Navy HQ”?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.39,0:08:30.72,Main,,0,0,0,,You better not be saying that this ship is heading for Navy HQ!Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.72,0:08:35.56,Main,,0,0,0,,You know about the war between  the Navy and the Whitebeard Pirates, right?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:37.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh, what?Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.53,0:08:38.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Navy HQ?Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:43.02,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?   It's not our fault that you're so dim-witted.Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.02,0:08:44.07,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.07,0:08:50.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Now that we're through the Gates of Justice, the only possible destinations are Enies Lobby and Navy HQ.Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.69,0:08:54.36,Captions,,0,0,0,,Navy Headquarters (Marineford)Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.69,0:08:54.36,Captions,,0,0,0,,Enies LobbyDialogue: 0,0:08:49.69,0:08:54.36,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Great Prison Impel DownDialogue: 0,0:08:49.69,0:08:54.36,Captions,,0,0,0,,Mary GeoiseDialogue: 0,0:08:50.82,0:08:54.65,Main,,0,0,0,,We're currently traveling the government's exclusive route, the Tarai Current.Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.65,0:08:58.44,Main,,0,0,0,,This is an enormous vortex that connects the government's three main facilities.Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.44,0:09:04.07,Main,,0,0,0,,The only reason we escaped in the first place was because we wanted to join the battle.Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:08.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the real fight starts now!Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.32,0:09:11.16,Main,,0,0,0,,“The real fight starts now?!”Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.16,0:09:14.12,Main,,0,0,0,,N-Nobody told us about this!Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.12,0:09:16.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop the ship right now, damn you!Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.76,0:09:18.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.00,0:09:22.00,Main,,0,0,0,,We're already riding the current. There's no way for me to stop it! Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.00,0:09:24.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you two just get off?Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.30,0:09:27.65,Main,,0,0,0,,-Ok, goodbye! -Bye!Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:32.48,Main,,0,0,0,,You really think we'll get off?!  We're both devil fruit users! We'd drown!Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:39.62,Main,,0,0,0,,The Navy high command and the Warlords versus the Whitebeard Pirates... this war is scary as hell! Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.95,0:09:55.21,Main,,0,0,0,,If that's where we're going, I'd rather go back to prison!Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:09:58.71,Main,,0,0,0,,All of us from 'Kama Land knew about this.Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:09.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you hear something?Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.64,0:10:33.15,Main,,0,0,0,,M-Maybe we should pretend we're not here?Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.22,0:10:37.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh, hello?Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:39.02,Main,,0,0,0,,He answered!Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.02,0:10:41.02,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Navy HQ.Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.02,0:10:42.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.75,0:10:44.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell him your name! You're a pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.52,0:10:52.46,Main,,0,0,0,,We received word from Impel Down security  that a group of escapees commandeered a ship.Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.01,0:10:57.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Judging from the information we received before we lost contact with Impel Down,Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.16,0:11:00.51,Main,,0,0,0,,we've determined that there are two ringleaders behind this breakout.Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.67,0:11:02.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Two?Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:05.33,Main,,0,0,0,,The pirate Straw Hat Luffy,Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.13,0:11:08.00,Main,,0,0,0,,and his fellow pirate...Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:09.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Buggy the Clown.Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.63,0:11:13.66,Main,,0,0,0,,-Huh?! -W-What?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.66,0:11:14.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Seriously?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.56,0:11:18.32,Main,,0,0,0,,They're treating Captain Buggy as a bigger threat than the warlords?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.32,0:11:20.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.37,0:11:23.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Why me?Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.65,0:11:24.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Hand me the papers.Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.99,0:11:26.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Here they are.Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.57,0:11:30.48,Main,,0,0,0,,We've underestimated you in the past.  We assumed you were just some upstart pirate.Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.48,0:11:33.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Buggy the Clown, we never would have guessed Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.54,0:11:38.49,Main,,0,0,0,,that you were a former crewmate of the pirate king, Gold Roger.Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.09,0:11:40.68,Main,,0,0,0,,How'd they find out?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.31,0:11:44.47,Main,,0,0,0,,You were on the Oro Jackson?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.47,0:11:45.71,Main,,0,0,0,,This is huge!Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.71,0:11:48.51,Main,,0,0,0,,A-A star! He's a pirate star!Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.51,0:11:54.91,Main,,0,0,0,,We've also received word that you are like a brother to Red-Haired Shanks of the Four Emperors.Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.91,0:11:56.49,Main,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.49,0:12:03.23,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed that a man of your caliber was able to lie low until now.Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.23,0:12:05.87,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't underestimate you,  now that you've come this far.Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.31,0:12:08.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh, no...Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.57,0:12:12.03,Main,,0,0,0,,We've yet to find any connection between you and Fire Fist Ace...Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.03,0:12:17.37,Main,,0,0,0,,but I'm sure your objective is the same as Straw Hat Luffy's: to save Ace.Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.37,0:12:22.25,Main,,0,0,0,,We've also confirmed that Jinbe, Crocodile, Ivankov,Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.25,0:12:27.54,Main,,0,0,0,,as well as over 200 other escapees, are on board the ship.Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:29.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you all now...Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.98,0:12:35.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Unless we open the Gates of Justice,  you will not be able to reach Marineford,Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.45,0:12:39.04,Main,,0,0,0,,nor will you be able to escape from the Tarai Current.Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.04,0:12:43.61,Main,,0,0,0,,None of you have any chance of escape. Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.13,0:12:47.24,Main,,0,0,0,,You'd better resign yourselves to that.Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.24,0:12:48.10,Main,,0,0,0,,That is all.Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.10,0:12:49.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, Navy!Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.25,0:12:55.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm definitely going to save Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.15,0:12:59.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll put your potatoes on a platter! Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.65,0:13:01.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Potatoes...?Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.28,0:13:09.95,Main,,0,0,0,,“Heads!” It's “heads on a platter,” Straw Hat-san! Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.95,0:13:13.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Like this is any time to be preparing potatoes! Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.65,0:13:17.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, why is this guy picking a fight with Navy HQ anyway?Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.72,0:13:20.41,Main,,0,0,0,,No, wait! More importantly, Captain Buggy, Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.41,0:13:23.10,Main,,0,0,0,,you were a member of the pirate king's crew?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.10,0:13:25.65,Main,,0,0,0,,And you're also like a brother to Red Hair?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.65,0:13:30.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Our savior is truly one amazing pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.40,0:13:31.27,Main,,0,0,0,,No, wait!Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.81,0:13:36.65,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap! Now that they know,  the government will start hunting me!Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.65,0:13:39.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I never expected him to have that kind of past.Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.26,0:13:41.28,Main,,0,0,0,,And despite that, he's so weak.Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.16,0:13:46.12,Main,,0,0,0,,But then, how can he be such a coward?Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.12,0:13:49.46,Main,,0,0,0,,There's at least one black sheep on every ship.Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.28,0:13:52.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.84,0:13:55.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it...Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.80,0:13:59.51,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If you're from the East Blue, then maybe you know a pirate named Buggy as well?Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.95,0:14:03.19,Main,,0,0,0,,That old first mate guy mentioned something about this, too.Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.47,0:14:05.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? The first mate?Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.36,0:14:09.52,Main,,0,0,0,,An old guy named Rayleigh. You know him, right?Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.52,0:14:13.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! You met Rayleigh-san?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.17,0:14:15.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that takes me back!  The first mate, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:16.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Where'd you meet him?Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.53,0:14:18.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Dark King Rayleigh's name came up!Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.99,0:14:20.49,Main,,0,0,0,,What an incredible conversation!Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.41,0:14:26.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy! You truly are a dangerous man! Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.08,0:14:27.21,Main,,0,0,0,,No, no!Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.21,0:14:28.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait a second!Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.81,0:14:30.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's true and all,Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.82,0:14:33.25,Main,,0,0,0,,but compared to those big shots,Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.25,0:14:35.52,Main,,0,0,0,,the life I've led up till now is just...Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.52,0:14:39.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You're amazing! You were a member of that legendary pirate crew!Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.67,0:14:42.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Buggy! Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.01,0:14:43.93,Main,,0,0,0,,You idiots!Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.26,0:14:48.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Quit cheering! I was technically just an apprentice!Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.73,0:14:52.84,Main,,0,0,0,,You may be grateful to me for freeing you, but...Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.84,0:14:56.32,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I'm telling you, you've got it wrong!Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.01,0:15:00.19,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Well, not all of it is wrong.Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.19,0:15:02.05,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Right! Wait a second...Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.05,0:15:07.13,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It's true that the Navy has  overestimated me, but this could be a good thing!Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.13,0:15:10.83,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That's right! Nothing they said was a lie!Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.83,0:15:13.96,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt that my reputation has grown! Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.96,0:15:16.17,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,If, by chance, someone...Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.17,0:15:17.46,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,like me...Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.92,0:15:23.89,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,manages to kill Whitebeard today, then I could become one of...Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.89,0:15:25.22,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,the Four Emperors?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.22,0:15:27.72,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, more than that...Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.68,0:15:31.48,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I could become king of the pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.48,0:15:36.67,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That's right! These escapees all have higher bounties than me!Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.67,0:15:38.90,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I could put them to good use!Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.11,0:15:43.15,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I can do it!Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.15,0:15:47.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy! We will follow you wherever you go!Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:54.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Just give the order! We'll steal the ship from the guys who wanna go to Navy HQ!Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:57.30,Main,,0,0,0,,And then we'll be free!Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.89,0:16:00.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, Straw Hat...Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.07,0:16:02.31,Main,,0,0,0,,how about handing this ship over to us?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.31,0:16:06.24,Main,,0,0,0,,We finally escaped! You think we'll go to Navy HQ?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.24,0:16:09.85,Main,,0,0,0,,We've got Captain Buggy on our side!Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.85,0:16:11.99,Main,,0,0,0,,We're counting on ya, Captain Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.23,0:16:14.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Buggy! Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:25.95,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Buggy! Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:16.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Such a nuisance...Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.69,0:16:20.09,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to kill them all.Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.79,0:16:25.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm starting to feel like I can do this!Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.95,0:16:39.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Buggy! Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.46,0:16:41.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Be silent, you brazen idiots! Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.34,0:16:45.72,Main,,0,0,0,,You're letting your emotions run away with you.Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.72,0:16:48.03,Main,,0,0,0,,This ship won't stop!Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.03,0:16:50.27,Main,,0,0,0,,It's headed straight for the battlefield!Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.27,0:16:53.68,Main,,0,0,0,,And we're all on board. Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.68,0:16:55.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Just think about it!Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.27,0:17:01.90,Main,,0,0,0,,We're within arm's reach of the summit, where the best of the best are!Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.90,0:17:05.39,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't get another chance like this again in our lifetimes.Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.36,0:17:10.30,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're real men, won't you come with me and fulfill your dreams?Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:16.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Today, I will take Whitebeard's head, and with it, the whole world! Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.25,0:17:18.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Captain Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.33,0:17:27.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.72,0:17:32.00,Main,,0,0,0,,We were plunged into the darkest depths of hell. Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:36.53,Main,,0,0,0,,At some point, we lost something important! Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.53,0:17:40.94,Main,,0,0,0,,We used to have it! That inner gem known as dreams!Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.94,0:17:43.62,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll follow you to the ends of the world!Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.62,0:17:45.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Who needs a peaceful life anyway?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.89,0:17:51.27,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! Let's go, men!Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.27,0:17:53.62,Main,,0,0,0,,To Navy HQ! Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.54,0:18:12.75,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Buggy! Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.54,0:17:58.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like they've come to an agreement.Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.56,0:18:01.29,Main,,0,0,0,,He seems to have a talent for convincing people, at least.Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.29,0:18:04.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy, you're one of the world's real trailblazers!Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.86,0:18:07.47,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll follow you anywhere!Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:10.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and follow me!Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.75,0:18:14.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Just do whatever vyou want. Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.45,0:18:24.92,Main,,0,0,0,,On the same island as Navy HQ, Marineford, Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.92,0:18:29.65,Main,,0,0,0,,there is a large town where mainly the marines' families reside. Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.73,0:18:42.92,Main,,0,0,0,,All those citizens have been ordered to evacuate.Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.33,0:18:55.05,Main,,0,0,0,,From their new haven in Sabaody Archipelago, the people eagerly watch the execution via monitors. Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.62,0:19:02.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Reporters and cameramen have  gathered from all over the worldDialogue: 0,0:19:02.68,0:19:07.66,Main,,0,0,0,,to watch and keep the rest of the world informed.Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.91,0:19:12.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Navy HQ has put all their forces into this. Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.69,0:19:16.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course. And I'm sure Whitebeard knows.Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.80,0:19:19.67,Main,,0,0,0,,So, will he really show?Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.89,0:19:26.15,Main,,0,0,0,,All scouting ships dispatched by the Navy have been sunk. Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.82,0:19:29.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Nobody has seen any trace of Whitebeard, Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.48,0:19:34.33,Main,,0,0,0,,and the tension at Marineford keeps building.Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.20,0:19:42.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Less than three hours remain before the execution.Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.05,0:20:11.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Go up the stairs. Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.92,0:20:35.21,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Listen, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.91,0:20:40.69,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We have to live our lives without regrets!Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.69,0:20:42.22,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.12,0:21:07.65,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Someday, we'll head out to sea, Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.65,0:21:09.85,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,and then we'll be able to do whatever we want!Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.91,0:21:14.71,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,No one will have more freedom than us!Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.38,0:21:39.78,Captions,,0,0,0,,The South BlueDialogue: 0,0:21:40.95,0:21:44.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Three hours to go. I wonder if  Whitebeard's already shown himself? Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.81,0:21:48.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Who knows. Are you sure he'll show? Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.27,0:21:51.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if this is Whitebeard,  he's gotten pretty old by now, right?Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.51,0:21:54.29,Main,,0,0,0,,You think?Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.29,0:21:57.63,Main,,0,0,0,,He's a relic from before the Great Pirate Era.Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.63,0:21:59.92,Main,,0,0,0,,He's probably gone senile by now.Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.92,0:22:03.63,Main,,0,0,0,,He's been quiet these last few years. Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.66,0:22:09.71,Captions,,0,0,0,,The East BlueDialogue: 0,0:22:10.42,0:22:13.13,Main,,0,0,0,,He's been around for ages.Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.85,0:22:17.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Can the Navy high command be defeated? Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.18,0:22:21.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Regardless of who wins,  there's going to be heavy casualties.Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.29,0:22:31.93,Main,,0,0,0,,It'd be best if he didn't show, and the execution went ahead without incident. Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.65,0:22:35.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,The North BlueDialogue: 0,0:22:38.73,0:22:42.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! I want some booze, old man!Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.14,0:22:44.85,Main,,0,0,0,,You think I'm gonna open the pub on a day like this?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.85,0:22:47.79,Main,,0,0,0,,War might break out, you know!Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.79,0:22:51.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Go home! If the world's still here tomorrow, I'll open the pub then!Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.58,0:22:53.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Then please, just sell me some booze!Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.98,0:22:57.39,Main,,0,0,0,,It feels like we're the ones facing execution here!Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.39,0:23:00.17,Main,,0,0,0,,We gotta have a drink to endure this!Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.84,0:23:06.50,Captions,,0,0,0,,The West BlueDialogue: 0,0:23:01.39,0:23:06.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't think of him as just some old guy; he's as strong as ever.Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.50,0:23:13.87,Main,,0,0,0,,We saw him a year ago, and he was just sitting there. Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.23,0:23:21.11,Main,,0,0,0,,We lost all hope that we would survive. Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.86,0:23:25.78,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Grand LineDialogue: 0,0:23:22.44,0:23:25.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Is Whitebeard really such a terrifying pirate?Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.75,0:23:28.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Even the kids know. Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.70,0:23:30.62,Main,,0,0,0,,They're singing about him while jumping rope.Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.62,0:23:35.49,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ The pirate, Whitebeard, scarier than the devil! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.01,0:23:37.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Dear Lord, Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.50,0:23:42.87,Main,,0,0,0,,where is this world headed?Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.74,0:23:55.45,Captions,,0,0,0,,Navy Headquarters Marineford, The Grand LineDialogue: 0,0:24:01.22,0:24:02.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry and get ready!Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.81,0:24:04.46,Main,,0,0,0,,You! Move it!Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.23,0:24:15.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Show no fear!Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.48,0:24:18.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, only three hours remain. Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.80,0:24:22.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Then all of this will be over! Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.78,0:24:34.02,Main,,0,0,0,,In all, more than 100,000 marines  have gathered from all over the world.Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.16,0:24:41.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Fifty battleships encircle the crescent-shaped bay.Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.04,0:24:45.96,Main,,0,0,0,,And within the bay, countless cannons are ready.Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.12,0:24:51.34,Main,,0,0,0,,The front row of the troops  can be seen from the port.Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.06,0:24:57.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Among them are the five rogues that could decide the outcome of this war, Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.20,0:24:59.78,Main,,0,0,0,,the members of the Seven Warlords of the Sea.Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.59,0:25:06.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Below the execution platform, Navy HQ's most powerful combat force stands guard: Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.34,0:25:10.59,Main,,0,0,0,,the three Navy admirals! Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.48,0:25:17.48,Captions,,0,0,0,,Navy Admiral “Aokiji” Kuzan Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.95,0:25:21.92,Captions,,0,0,0,,Navy Admiral “Akainu” Sakazuki Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.33,0:25:26.30,Captions,,0,0,0,,Navy Admiral “Kizaru” Borsalino Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.96,0:25:31.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.21,0:25:34.47,Main,,0,0,0,,all the world's forces of justice... Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.47,0:25:37.10,Main,,0,0,0,,await the Whitebeard Pirates... Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.10,0:25:40.41,Main,,0,0,0,,to prevent them from rescuing Ace. Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.44,0:26:00.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I see it!Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.06,0:26:02.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.87,0:26:06.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I can see the Gate of Justice!Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.07,0:26:07.41,Main,,0,0,0,,That was fast!Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.41,0:26:09.40,Main,,0,0,0,,No, we're actually pretty late!Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.40,0:26:12.48,Main,,0,0,0,,If the wind had been more favorable, we would have arrived sooner!Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.14,0:26:17.69,Main,,0,0,0,,So, how are we going to get through that gate?Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.22,0:26:21.49,Main,,0,0,0,,My men! It's almost time!Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.27,0:26:24.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Time for what?Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.03,0:26:27.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Time for Captain Buggy to take over the world!Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.40,0:26:29.93,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right, my comrades!Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.93,0:26:32.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Who cares about Navy HQ?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.48,0:26:46.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! There's Fire Fist Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.15,0:26:57.53,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the man that could trigger this world-changing war! Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.13,0:27:06.54,Main,,0,0,0,,The fate of the world depends on him!Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.20,0:27:36.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna tell them everything, Garp.Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.51,0:27:39.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Do whatever you want. I'll be down there.Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.10,0:27:47.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Stand down.Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.46,0:27:48.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.05,0:27:50.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral Sengoku!Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.97,0:27:52.05,Main,,0,0,0,,What's happening?Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.05,0:27:53.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Give me the transponder snail.Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.72,0:27:54.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.24,0:28:06.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I have an announcement for you all.Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.13,0:28:13.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Portgas D. Ace...Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.18,0:28:18.04,Main,,0,0,0,,The execution of this man is of paramount importance.Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.71,0:28:22.02,Main,,0,0,0,,You've done nothing wrong.Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.60,0:28:28.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Women always get sympathetic at times like this, Tsuru-chan.Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.62,0:28:32.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace. What is your father's name?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.02,0:28:38.01,Main,,0,0,0,,His father?Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.01,0:28:39.83,Main,,0,0,0,,What's this all about?Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.80,0:28:44.64,Main,,0,0,0,,My father is Whitebeard.Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.64,0:28:45.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Not true!Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.67,0:28:49.84,Main,,0,0,0,,It is! Whitebeard is the only father I have!Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.66,0:28:55.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Years ago, we dedicated a lot of manpower to following his movements.Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.45,0:28:59.83,Main,,0,0,0,,We suspected that man might have conceived a child on a certain island.Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.83,0:29:05.23,Main,,0,0,0,,We relied entirely on Cipher Pol's vague information about this possibility.Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.23,0:29:07.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Newborns...Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.31,0:29:10.76,Main,,0,0,0,,The unborn...Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.76,0:29:16.23,Main,,0,0,0,,We investigated every possible infant and their mothers but we found nothing.Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.04,0:29:18.81,Main,,0,0,0,,But I suppose that was to be expected.Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.81,0:29:23.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Your mother risked her life to deliver you safely.Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.02,0:29:26.71,Main,,0,0,0,,She performed a special trick. Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.20,0:29:38.03,Main,,0,0,0,,She deceived us...  No, she deceived the whole world!Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.03,0:29:41.66,Main,,0,0,0,,She lived on an island called Baterilla, in the South Blue.Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.88,0:29:47.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Her name was Portgas D. Rouge.Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.40,0:29:54.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Your mother used her sheer willpower to pull off something unimaginable.Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.84,0:29:59.71,Main,,0,0,0,,She carried her child in her womb for 20 whole months.Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.11,0:30:04.11,Main,,0,0,0,,What is he saying?Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.11,0:30:10.29,Main,,0,0,0,,She used all of her strength  and died as soon as she gave birth to you. Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.78,0:30:17.19,Main,,0,0,0,,And so a year and three months after the father's death, Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.19,0:30:22.25,Main,,0,0,0,,a child was born, carrying the blood of the most evil man in the world.Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.66,0:30:27.37,Main,,0,0,0,,That child was you!Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.34,0:30:33.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you already know...Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.85,0:30:44.32,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,A newborn bears no sin.Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.89,0:30:46.73,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Garp.Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.48,0:30:49.53,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Take care of my child.Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.96,0:30:54.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Your father is...Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.68,0:31:02.34,Main,,0,0,0,,the pirate king, Gold Roger!Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.37,0:00:26.77,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.37,0:00:26.77,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.65,0:00:25.47,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 0,0:00:25.47,0:00:26.87,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 1,0:00:24.73,0:00:25.59,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 1,0:00:24.73,0:00:25.59,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:00:24.73,0:00:25.59,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.59,0:00:26.99,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,meDialogue: 1,0:00:24.81,0:00:25.78,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0