idomaru koto nakuComment: 0,0:02:00.06,0:02:05.35,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Nagareru toki ni makenai youniComment: 0,0:02:05.36,0:02:10.99,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Nando mo tachimukai tsuzukeyouComment: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:16.35,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Taisetsu na mono ushinaitakunai karaComment: 0,0:02:16.36,0:02:22.05,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Shinjita sono saki he to...Comment: 0,0:00:25.37,0:00:25.37,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,,Comment: 0,0:00:25.37,0:00:30.62,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,雨｜あ#｜め上｜!あがりの空｜そ#｜らを仰｜あ#｜おぐ度｜た#｜びComment: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:36.13,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,泣｜なき虫｜む#｜しだった頃｜こ#｜ろの僕｜ぼ#｜くを思｜お#｜もうComment: 0,0:00:36.13,0:00:43.87,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,誰｜だ#｜れかの背｜せ中｜!な#｜かをがむしゃらに追｜おいかけたComment: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:46.85,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,「強｜つ#｜よくなりたい」ってComment: 0,0:00:46.85,0:00:52.03,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,今｜い#｜まは風｜か#｜ぜに消｜きえた「ありがとう」Comment: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:57.21,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,僕｜ぼ#｜くは強｜つ#｜よくなれているのかな?Comment: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:02.88,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,答｜こ#｜たえはまだ出｜でそうにないからさComment: 0,0:01:03.01,0:01:08.40,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,やっぱりまだ歩｜あ#｜るいていくよComment: 0,0:01:08.55,0:01:11.03,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,さぁ行｜ゆこうComment: 0,0:01:11.03,0:01:14.24,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,立｜たち止｜どまることなくComment: 0,0:01:14.24,0:01:19.48,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,流｜な#｜がれる時｜と#｜きに負｜まけないようにComment: 0,0:01:19.48,0:01:25.09,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,何｜なん度｜!ども立｜たち向｜むかい続｜つ#｜づけようComment: 0,0:01:25.10,0:01:30.73,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,大｜た#｜い切｜!せ#｜つなもの失｜<う#｜し#｜ないたくないからComment: 0,0:01:30.74,0:01:35.85,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,僕｜ぼ#｜くの中｜な#｜かに流｜な#｜がれる声｜こ#｜えはComment: 0,0:01:35.86,0:01:41.25,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,ずっとずっと僕｜ぼ#｜くを支｜さ#｜さえてるComment: 0,0:01:41.25,0:01:46.38,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,イタズラな雨｜あ#｜めが邪｜じゃ魔｜!まするけどComment: 0,0:01:46.39,0:01:51.32,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,逃｜にげ出｜ださないからComment: 0,0:01:54.42,0:01:56.78,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,さぁ行｜ゆこうComment: 0,0:01:56.78,0:02:00.06,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,立｜たち止｜どまることなくComment: 0,0:02:00.06,0:02:05.35,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,流｜な#｜がれる時｜と#｜きに負｜まけないようにComment: 0,0:02:05.36,0:02:10.99,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,何｜なん度｜!ども立｜たち向｜むかい続｜つ#｜づけようComment: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:16.35,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,大｜た#｜い切｜!せ#｜つなもの失｜<う#｜し#｜ないたくないからComment: 0,0:02:16.36,0:02:22.05,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,信｜し#｜んじたその先｜さ#｜きへと...Comment: 0,0:00:23.37,0:00:25.37,DefaultLow,,0,0,0,,Comment: 0,0:00:25.37,0:00:30.62,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Every time I look up to the sky after the rainComment: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:36.13,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I think back to when I was a crybabyComment: 0,0:00:36.13,0:00:43.87,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I was chasing somebody's back blindlyComment: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:46.85,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Thinking "I want to be stronger"Comment: 0,0:00:46.85,0:00:52.03,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The word "thank you" has faded into the wind nowComment: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:57.21,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Am I getting stronger?Comment: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:02.88,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I don't know the answer yetComment: 0,0:01:03.01,0:01:08.40,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,That's why I'll keep walking aheadComment: 0,0:01:08.55,0:01:11.03,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,So let's goComment: 0,0:01:11.03,0:01:14.24,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Without stoppingComment: 0,0:01:14.24,0:01:19.48,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Without giving up to the flow of timeComment: 0,0:01:19.48,0:01:25.09,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I'll keep getting back upComment: 0,0:01:25.10,0:01:30.73,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Because I don't want to lose something preciousComment: 0,0:01:30.74,0:01:35.85,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The voice inside of meComment: 0,0:01:35.86,0:01:41.25,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,keeps sustaining meComment: 0,0:01:41.25,0:01:46.38,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Wicked rain will get in my wayComment: 0,0:01:46.39,0:01:51.32,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,But I won't walk awayComment: 0,0:01:54.42,0:01:56.78,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,So let's goComment: 0,0:01:56.78,0:02:00.06,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Without stoppingComment: 0,0:02:00.06,0:02:05.35,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Without giving up to the flow of timeComment: 0,0:02:05.36,0:02:10.99,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I'll keep getting back upComment: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:16.35,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Because I don't want to lose something preciousComment: 0,0:02:16.36,0:02:22.05,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,To the future I believe in...